<div class="space-y-3"><label class="field">Instructions for the prompt writer<textarea x-model="containerUserPrompt" :disabled="containerPromptBusy" rows="3" maxlength="10000" placeholder="Describe how the container should open and how to arrange the selected items."></textarea></label><button type="button" class="btn-secondary" :disabled="containerRun||containerBusy||containerPromptBusy||!containerUserPrompt.trim()||!containerItems.length" @click="draftContainerPrompt()" x-text="containerPromptBusy?'Writing prompt…':'Draft image prompt with AI'"></button><p x-show="containerError" x-text="containerError" class="text-sm text-red-700 dark:text-red-300"></p><p class="text-xs">Uses the model selected in chat. Edit the image prompt before generating. Only the final instructions and edited prompt are added to chat when you generate the container image.</p></div>
